"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3170480","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2654210-1846651706685828","game_id":"steam-2654210","kind":"announcement","title":"Four's a Crowd","summary":"PHASMONAUTS GOES MULTIPLAYER!ONLY DURING STEAM NEXT FEST! My friends told me this was a terrible idea... so naturally, I'm doing it anyway. The Phasmonauts demo is getting a TEMPORARY MULTIPLAYER UPDATE! Grab your friends, investigate haunted locations, suck up souls, and try not to get everyone killed. This build will go LIVE Sunday @ 6:00 PM EST.BUT THERE'S A CATCH...Once Steam Next Fest ends, the demo will return to SINGLE-PLAYER ONLY.If you want to play with your friends again, you'll have t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T23:55:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685828","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2654210-1839041357027190","game_id":"steam-2654210","kind":"announcement","title":"Will You Be There?","summary":"Phasmonauts Demo Update + Early Access Announcement!A new update is now live for the Phasmonauts demo! This update adds a few things I've been working toward for a while: Saving: Your progress can now be saved between runs.Ouija Board: Lost a character? You can now try to summon them back... if you're brave enough.New Tutorial: A new tutorial has been added to help make sure your first expedition is successful.And now for the big news... Phasmonauts is coming to Early Access on October 29th! I'm","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T16:12:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357027190","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2654210-1835236783565802","game_id":"steam-2654210","kind":"update","title":"Haunting Overhaul! (MAJOR UPDATE)","summary":"Update HighlightsApparition OverhaulThe Apparition now pays much closer attention to player behavior. Actions such as improper kills, reckless movement, and other disruptive choices will increase its aggression throughout the match.Weapon CachesWeapons are no longer handed out freely. Hidden caches can now be discovered throughout the map, including hollow tree stumps and disturbed graves. Exploration is now the primary way to expand your arsenal beyond the starting pistol.Rest RoomsNew pond-sid","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-13T12:37:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783565802","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2654210-1814309641547411","game_id":"steam-2654210","kind":"announcement","title":"We’re in Scream Fest!","summary":"Phasmonauts is in Steam Scream Fest! The free demo is packed with over 2 hours of content you won’t want to miss.Investigate EverythingUse ghost-hunting gear like the EMF Reader and Spirit Journal… or try unconventional methods. Choose Your PhasmonautMae – Fast, fragile, double-dash.Otis – Ammo pro, medium sanity drain.Isaiah – Pistol marksman, +30% damage.Champ – Tanky powerhouse with Comet Dash.Collect Souls. Unlock Sigils. Experiment with upgrades and builds each run. See how far you can surv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-26T20:00:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641547411","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2654210-1813041031352595","game_id":"steam-2654210","kind":"announcement","title":"Happy Hunting","summary":"Phasmonauts Demo Launches October 24th!Mark your calendars, the free demo for Phasmonauts arrives October 24th!Grab your gear, rally your crew, and step into the woods to uncover which cryptid is haunting the campsite. Find 3 clues, piece together the evidence, and face off against the monster that lurks in the dark.Investigate with Every Tool You’ve Got...You’ll use both traditional ghost-hunting gear like the EMF Reader and Spirit Journal, and some... less conventional methods - ever use concr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-13T23:14:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813041031352595","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2654210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2654210":"2026-10-26T09:54:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2654210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:59Z"},"3170480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:59Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2654210","app_id":2654210,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"388d77985df30c2e2202d00e1a853e3eb48e0750d9e625cf7f21cceb9f0b4ae3","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Phasmonauts is a 4 